<title>UK: TABLE-Stanley Leisure yr profits rise.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Stanley Leisure yr profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to April 27, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		  11.7		 vs   9.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	    2.8		 vs    na</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)    4.0		 vs   3.33</p>
<p> Pretax*			20.1		 vs  14.8</p>
<p> Turnover		    406.8		 vs 318.1</p>
<p>NOTE - *The profits is before taking exceptional loss of 0.7 million stg into account.</p>
<p>Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 18 and 20 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Stanley Leisure Plc.</p>
<p>---London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
